---
import SystemsCanvas from '../three/SystemsCanvas';
---

<section id="top" class="relative flex min-h-[100svh] items-center overflow-hidden bg-ink">
  <div class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-0" aria-hidden="true">
    <SystemsCanvas client:only="react" />
  </div>

  <div class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-b from-ink/10 via-ink/40 to-ink"></div>

  <div class="relative z-10 mx-auto w-full max-w-6xl px-6 pt-24 sm:px-10">
    <p data-reveal class="font-sans text-sm uppercase tracking-[0.25em] text-signal">
      Design thinking &middot; Systems &middot; Technology
    </p>

    <h1
      data-reveal
      data-reveal-delay="0.1"
      class="text-balance mt-6 max-w-4xl font-display text-4xl font-semibold leading-[1.05] text-paper sm:text-6xl md:text-7xl"
    >
      I ask why it needs to exist, <em class="text-accent not-italic">before</em> what to build.
    </h1>

    <p
      data-reveal
      data-reveal-delay="0.2"
      class="text-balance mt-8 max-w-xl font-sans text-lg leading-relaxed text-paper-dim sm:text-xl"
    >
      I work at the intersection of humans and technology — not as a developer, but as someone
      who understands what technology can and cannot do, and how to turn that understanding into
      real impact in health, education, and poverty alleviation.
    </p>

    <div data-reveal data-reveal-delay="0.3" class="mt-12 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-4">
      <a
        href="#work"
        class="rounded-full bg-accent px-7 py-3 font-sans text-sm font-medium text-ink transition-transform duration-300 hover:scale-105"
      >
        See selected work
      </a>
      <a
        href="#contact"
        class="rounded-full border border-paper-dim/30 px-7 py-3 font-sans text-sm font-medium text-paper transition-colors duration-300 hover:border-signal hover:text-signal"
      >
        Get in touch
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
